# BeerMe master doctrine

Read `@AGENTS.md` and `@CONTEXT.md` at session start.

## Non-negotiables (summary)

- LLM → axis updates only; **Python computes session confidence**.
- Recommender → **catalog IDs/names only**; no invented beers.
- LLM must not change scores, catalog, or confidence math.
- Ollama in `ollama_client.py`; pytest uses fixtures for engine logic.
- One issue → one chat; board is source of truth for work.

## Subagent routing

| Path / ticket | Subagent |
|---------------|----------|
| `app/ollama_client.py`, `app/prompts.py` | `/orion` |
| `app/taste_profile.py`, `app/recommender.py`, `data/*` | `/engine` |
| `app/main.py`, `app/export_md.py` | `/voyager` |
| Phase 7, smoke, release check | `/verify` (readonly) |

Skills handle procedure (`tdd`, `to-issues`, `triage`, etc.). Subagents enforce domain boundaries.
